I have been playing patchlevel 6, in Wizard mode for quite some time. I
started out saying that I would not cheat any more than absolutely
necessary.  The idea was that I would learn about the game so later on I
could more intelligently attack it.  Well, My working AC is about -9,
my strength is 25, I have a +6 Mjollnir, and some other named weapons.
In order to get a decent game, my early promise went out the window fairly
quickly.

I'm not bragging, in fact, I am complaining.  This character has died about
40 times.  Nearly every time I meet a minotaur (those bastards are tough!),
I die.  And the only consistent way I have found to dispatch the Wiz is to
wish up a cockatrice corpse.  I hate having to do it, but I can't figure
out another way.  (Touch of death???)

There are other monsters that do me in, too, but those two are the worst.

My feeling is that this is too hard.  I am sure others have won fair and
square.  I would love to know how.  I have won previous editions of hack,
but NH3.0 has consistently done me in soundly.

Perhaps I am missing something.  I don't know.

Also, what is the deal with this malignant aura that surrounds me and
curses items?  Is there a cure for that???  Where did it come from?

